{"qid": "b09", "family": "b", "split": "test", "method": "M3", "model": "glm", "answer": {"method": "M3", "model": "glm", "final": {"answer": "Per the Fisher ET datasheet (D100022X012, Table 17), the Cv at maximum valve plug travel for a 2 in. valve is 59.7 for ED and ETR (full-sized trim, equal percentage cage, normal flow direction); for EAT it is 48.1 with liner or 47.2 without liner. The documents do not state which specific model PV-2-1 is, so the value for PV-2-1 itself is not definitively stated.", "not_present": false}, "outcome": "ANSWERED", "route": ["context_rag+chunks"], "cypher": [], "sources": [{"document_id": "gfps-165-solenoid-valve", "pages": [5, 2, 3, 1]}, {"document_id": "fisher-et-d100022x012", "pages": [23, 36, 32]}, {"document_id": "flowserve-worcester-f51-f52", "pages": [10, 11, 8]}, {"document_id": "rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001", "pages": [98, 106]}], "latency_s": 24.028301499958616, "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 15366, "completion_tokens": 3087, "cost_usd": 0.0003736893, "spent_usd": 0.0003736893, "n_calls": 2, "n_cached": 0, "models": ["qwen/qwen3-embedding-8b", "z-ai/glm-5.3-flash"]}, "trace": {"chunks": [{"document_id": "gfps-165-solenoid-valve", "page": 5, "score": 0.6651}, {"document_id": "fisher-et-d100022x012", "page": 23, "score": 0.6619}, {"document_id": "fisher-et-d100022x012", "page": 36, "score": 0.6408}, {"document_id": "flowserve-worcester-f51-f52", "page": 10, "score": 0.6373}, {"document_id": "gfps-165-solenoid-valve", "page": 2, "score": 0.6304}, {"document_id": "gfps-165-solenoid-valve", "page": 3, "score": 0.6291}, {"document_id": "gfps-165-solenoid-valve", "page": 1, "score": 0.6241}, {"document_id": "flowserve-worcester-f51-f52", "page": 11, "score": 0.6153}, {"document_id": "rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001", "page": 98, "score": 0.6026}, {"document_id": "flowserve-worcester-f51-f52", "page": 8, "score": 0.6021}, {"document_id": "rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001", "page": 106, "score": 0.5948}, {"document_id": "fisher-et-d100022x012", "page": 32, "score": 0.5937}], "prompt_chars": 36483, "reply": "The Fisher ET valve datasheet (D100022X012, Table 17, \"Maximum Flow Coefficients for Full-Sized Trim with Equal Percentage Cage and Normal Flow Direction\") gives the Cv at maximum valve plug travel for a 2 in. valve as 59.7 for the ED and ETR designs; for the EAT design it is 48.1 (with liner) or 47.2 (without liner). The excerpts do not state which specific model (ED, EAT, or ETR) PV-2-1 is, so the exact value for PV-2-1 itself is not stated; 59.7 applies if it is an ED or ETR 2 in. valve.\n\n{\"answer\": \"Per the Fisher ET datasheet (D100022X012, Table 17), the Cv at maximum valve plug travel for a 2 in. valve is 59.7 for ED and ETR (full-sized trim, equal percentage cage, normal flow direction); for EAT it is 48.1 with liner or 47.2 without liner. The documents do not state which specific model PV-2-1 is, so the value for PV-2-1 itself is not definitively stated.\", \"not_present\": false}"}}}
