4001", "page": 16, "score": 0.5446}], "prompt_chars": 32837, "reply": "{\"answer\": \"GV-2-2 is a solenoid valve covered by the GF Piping Systems Type 165 2/2-way solenoid valve datasheet, so yes, it needs electrical power to operate. The datasheet lists available supply voltages of 24V DC, 230V 50Hz/60Hz, and 115V 50Hz/60Hz (with ±10% voltage tolerance), so 24 V DC will work — 230 V AC is not required. Note the valve also requires a minimum differential pressure of 0.5 bar to open and close.\", \"not_present\": false}"}}}
